    <string name="gemini_live_description">Enable and save to send audio from the selected app to Google through Gemini Live. It detects the source language and returns speech in the target language without loading Whisper. Use your personal Gemini API key, stored separately from the screen translation key. Costs and limits depend on your Google AI Studio project. The translated voice is AI-generated.</string>
